      <section class="section-faq">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1280 w-container">
          <div class="faq-wrapper">
            <div class="left_side-faq">
              <div class="header-faq">
                <div class="text_heading-faq">
                  <div class="text-12-caps opacity-60 center-small">Frequently asked questions</div>
                  <div class="max-w-400">
                    <h2 class="h2 center-small"><span class="span-pink-2">Got questions?<br>‍</span>We&#x27;ve got answers</h2>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80 center-small">We want to make sure you feel confident that our service is right for you. Here we’ve looked to address some commonly asked questions. If you have any more specific questions, don’t hesitate to get in touch with a member of the team.</p>
              </div><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Frame-1707478606_4.avif" alt="An abstract digital interface featuring a dark theme with various input fields, a progress bar, and a question mark icon, suggesting a user-friendly design for a software application." class="image-faq">
            </div>
            <div class="right_side-faq">
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="966918e9-f2a5-7b10-d081-1c04f831d2b4" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">How long does it usually take for a web design project?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="966918e9-f2a5-7b10-d081-1c04f831d2b8" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">That depends, honestly. Some pages can take weeks or even longer, especially if they’re super intricate with lots of interactivity and custom creative assets. But at Motion The Agency, we move fast. It usually takes us around 3 days to design a single page.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="966918e9-f2a5-7b10-d081-1c04f831d2cc" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Once the design is finished, if i need to change some things for a campaign how would i do that?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="966918e9-f2a5-7b10-d081-1c04f831d2d0" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">You can easily make changes yourself through your CMS, like swapping out images or tweaking text. If you need any layout adjustments, that might need a bit of technical work, but we focus on design, so that’s something you can control easily on your end. and if this change during our partnership we&#x27;re always here to help with any new designs or tweaks you need!</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="966918e9-f2a5-7b10-d081-1c04f831d2d9" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Does a proper web design affect my site visibility?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="966918e9-f2a5-7b10-d081-1c04f831d2dd" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Yes, absolutely! When it comes to SEO, a well-designed page plays a major role in boosting your visibility. From mobile-friendliness and user engagement to incorporating creative assets, all these factors help with SEO. Think of it like this — the right design elements are like extra points on a test, if Google were the teacher.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="966918e9-f2a5-7b10-d081-1c04f831d2e2" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Who will be working on my web design project?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="966918e9-f2a5-7b10-d081-1c04f831d2e6" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Well, we can’t speak for other agencies, but at Motion The Agency, once you subscribe to our services, we’ll build a dedicated team tailored to your needs. This includes graphic designers, UI/UX designers, animators, copywriters, frontend developers, and project managers. Whatever you need, we’ll do our best to make it happen for you.Well, we can’t speak for other agencies, but at Motion The Agency, once you subscribe to our services, we’ll build a dedicated team tailored to your needs. This includes graphic designers, UI/UX designers, animators, copywriters, frontend developers, and project managers. Whatever you need, we’ll do our best to make it happen for you.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="966918e9-f2a5-7b10-d081-1c04f831d2ee" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">How much does it cost for a web design services?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="966918e9-f2a5-7b10-d081-1c04f831d2f2" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">With us, web design projects are billed on a flat-rate monthly basis. If you&#x27;re looking for just minor updates to your page, our plans start at:<br><br>- <strong>$3,680/month</strong> for our <strong>Basic Plan</strong><br>- <strong>$5,980/month</strong> for our <strong>Premium Plan</strong><br>We’ll work with you to find the right fit based on your needs!</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
